            "line": 129,
            "text": "theorem cylindricalPressure_next (G : ScaledGraph) (n : ℕ) (p₀ : Cylinder → ℝ) :\n    cylindricalPressure G n p₀ (p.next v c u) =\n      cylindricalPressure G n p₀ u + cylindricalStepPressure p v c u G n"
